    "\n",
    "With optimal Sentinel scenes selected, the next step prepares building-level spatial anchors for feature extraction. Rather than operating on full building polygons, the pipeline derives a single, stable centroid per structure to serve as the reference point for sampling Sentinel pixels and neighborhood statistics.\n",
