    "## Extracting Building-Scale Sentinel-1 Features\n",
    "Following optical feature extraction, the pipeline incorporates **Sentinel-1 radar data** to add cloud-independent structural context. Unlike optical sensors, Sentinel-1 penetrates cloud cover and is sensitive to surface roughness and built form, making it a complementary signal for urban heat analysis.\n",
