    "Radar backscatter from the VV and VH polarizations is clipped to the study area and summarized around **200 m buffers** centered on each building. From these bands, the **VH/VV ratio** is derived to capture differences in scattering behavior associated with urban materials, vertical structure, and surface complexity.\n",
