    "As with Sentinel-2, zonal statistics are computed per building buffer to summarize the mean, variability, and valid pixel coverage of the radar-derived feature. Batch processing ensures scalability while preserving alignment with previously extracted optical features.\n",
    "\n",
    "This step extends the feature space beyond spectral reflectance, introducing a weather-robust, structure-sensitive signal that strengthens the physical basis of the final UHI modeling dataset."
