    "## Sentinel Feature Missingness Resolution and Dataset Finalization\n",
    "\n",
    "Following the spatial and causal diagnosis of Sentinel feature missingness, the next step in the pipeline focuses on **resolving missing data in a way that preserves physical meaning, avoids artificial signal injection, and ensures modeling readiness**. Crucially, the handling strategy is **cause-aware**, directly leveraging the earlier classification of missingness drivers (water bodies vs. urban cloud/shadow effects).\n",
